      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLD CODE (1) comes into this as a quickest on the card winner last time at The Meadows, scoring by a nose (35.03). Looks a top chance again. WIZARD WATSON (3) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 2.75 lengths from the winner (25.44). Has placed several times at this track. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. One of the better chances. CARRY ON MACI (6) is generally an honest type in the frame at 11 of 35 starts but missed the placings last time when seventh (30.71) over 515m at this track. Goes well from this draw. Will go close here with a clear run. NOVA ROSE (2) will be hard to beat despite making her debut at this circuit.",
